{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/17135-animal-stats","id":17135,"title":"Animal stats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-24T08:49:20-08:00","id":17135,"title":"Animal stats","content":"I am new, so excuse me if this question is annoying. I am having trouble with finding out the statistics of various animals for my personal use. In any case, what are the statistics for a dog, a 1 dot creature? If someone could tell me the page number and book of the animal stats that would be very helpful too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1306-bobbybobby99","name":"Bobbybobby99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T09:00:25-08:00","id":17140,"title":"","content":"I don't have the book at hand right now, but all animal stats available in the books are presented at the end of the Antagonists section on Scion: Hero. Try to see the very last pages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://s56.photobucket.com/user/Solkannar/media/assinatura-Man-in-Black-mas.gif.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i56.photobucket.com/albums/g165/Solkannar/assinatura-Man-in-Black-mas.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/384-man-in-black","name":"Man in Black","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar384_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T13:09:07-08:00","id":17260,"title":"","content":"Bear in mind, however, that those animal stats are pretty limited. I'd highly recommend using those as a jumping-off point and brewing up your own animals. Obviously a Jack Russel Terrier and a Great Dane are both dogs, but nothing alike in terms of stats. In the same way,a Kite and an Eagle are both predatory birds, but worlds apart in size.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Games are a way for us to explore what it means to be human, or inhuman, as the case may be. Let's all have a good time playing them.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/400-guitarsniper","name":"guitarsniper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T08:39:44-08:00","id":20200,"title":"","content":"You can find common animals on Hero, page 328.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/645-horseman","name":"Horseman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar645_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T09:30:25-08:00","id":20220,"title":"","content":"And if someone is taking the background to get a dog, you'll want to make it something special anyway. Just a regular old dog is going to quickly die or be overshadowed in a typical Scion story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some online tools, including a Scion/Exalted battle wheel? <a href=\"http://rpg-tools.org/generators/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpg-tools.org/generators/index.php</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/829-james-mcmurray","name":"James McMurray","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}